# name: test/sql/optimizer/joins/join_order_deep_setop_chain.test
# description: Deeply nested set operations must not exhaust the stack in the join order optimizer (oss-fuzz)
# group: [joins]

# every EXCEPT nests three operators (set op, projection, distinct), each of which starts a nested join order
# optimizer: with ~200 of them the recursion got deep enough to overflow the stack in sanitizer builds
loop i 0 2

statement ok
